的风格统一性，确保其符合项目所在景区/文博场馆的历史文化调性。","Require":"1. 本科及以上学历，美术专业优先，数字媒体艺术、动画设计、插画设计等美术设计类相关专业，具备扎实的美术功底和优秀的色彩构成能力；\n2. 2年以上AR/VR/XR数字内容设计、文旅展陈多媒体设计、游戏UI设计、博物馆数字化视觉设计相关项目经验，对沉浸式交互体验的视觉设计有较强的理解与实践经验，有成功落地的AR设计项目案例及成熟海报设计作品优先；\n3. 熟练使用Photoshop、illustrator等主流设计软件，具备极强的AI+AR效果图输出能力、视觉创意表达能力，精通海报创意设计、版式排版、物料输出全流程，具备AIGC辅助设计的应用经验者优先；\n4. 具备极强的创意落地能力——能把策划口中的文字描述变成震撼的视觉画面。熟悉多种美术风格，良好的沟通能力，能理解技术边界，在“视觉盛宴”和“落地性”之间找到最优解。\n\n投递简历时，请附上您的作品集，谢谢。","ClassificationOne":"设计类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-07-28T10:38:33","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"a4687849-9d05-4c2b-bc00-74479aa634af","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151209125,"PostDateInt":1782799646000,"PostDate":"2026-06-30T14:07:26","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"渠道BD（北美）","O